From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivo Nunes <ivo@nunes.uk>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:36:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] steam.exe: Run on macOS.

Wheelio: Proton's steam helper, adapted for the Mac Steam client:

- steam:// links and commands go to /usr/bin/open, which hands them to
  the Mac client, rather than Linux Steam's steam-runtime-steam-remote.
- No CoInitialize, and so no ole32 import: on macOS it gives the helper
  a Dock icon of its own next to the game's (found by NotProton).

Origin: Wheelio, on Proton's steam_helper (BSD-3-Clause, see the
copyright notice in steam.c).
---
 programs/steam.exe/Makefile.in | 2 +-
 programs/steam.exe/steam.c     | 7 ++-----
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/programs/steam.exe/Makefile.in b/programs/steam.exe/Makefile.in
index 3b57bd1..fdb2338 100644
--- a/programs/steam.exe/Makefile.in
+++ b/programs/steam.exe/Makefile.in
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 MODULE    = steam.exe
-IMPORTS   = user32 advapi32 shlwapi shell32 msi ole32
+IMPORTS   = user32 advapi32 shlwapi shell32 msi
 
 EXTRADLLFLAGS = -mwindows
 
diff --git a/programs/steam.exe/steam.c b/programs/steam.exe/steam.c
index b81622d..4802de4 100644
--- a/programs/steam.exe/steam.c
+++ b/programs/steam.exe/steam.c
@@ -502,8 +502,6 @@ static HANDLE run_process(BOOL *should_await, BOOL game_process)
 
         dos = wine_get_dos_file_name(scratchA);
 
-        CoInitialize(NULL);
-
         console = SHGetFileInfoW(dos, 0, &sfi, sizeof(sfi), SHGFI_EXETYPE);
         if (console)
         {
@@ -659,11 +657,10 @@ static BOOL steam_command_handler(int argc, char *argv[])
     HMODULE module;
     const char *sgi;
     int i, j;
+    /* macOS opens steam:// links in the Mac client. */
     static char *unix_steam[] =
     {
-        (char *)"steam-runtime-steam-remote",
-        (char *)"steam",
-        NULL,
+        (char *)"/usr/bin/open",
     };
 
     /* If there are command line options, only forward steam:// and options start with - */
